# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Env
.env

# SOPS-encrypted prod secrets. The tooling (.sops.yaml, scripts/prod-compose.sh) is committed,
# but the encrypted payload and the age private key are kept OUT of git (Option A): they live
# only on the prod box + an off-box backup. Lose the age key and secrets.env is unrecoverable.
secrets.env
*.agekey
keys.txt

# Cloudflare Origin certificate + private key (mounted into Caddy in prod). NEVER commit.
docker/caddy/certs/

# Maven Wrapper
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# Internal scratch / review reports (not for portfolio)
*_REPORT.md
*_REVIEW.md

# Stray SSH keypair committed by mistake — `finsight.pub` is actually a PRIVATE key.
# Rotate it (treat as compromised) and never commit keys.
/finsight.pub
/finsight.pub.pub

# Debug/error screenshots shared for support — not part of the project.
ErrorImage/
# Personal scratch notes
/state.md
/project-status.md

# Android signing + build output, if the Play Store TWA is ever built here (docs/android-twa.md).
# The keystore IS the app's identity on Play: committing it hands anyone the ability to ship an
# update as you, and losing it means the listing can never be updated again by anyone.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.aab
*.apk
